  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}………\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e724_241.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 76 11}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}……怎么了？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e724_241.bf.json:8:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0C 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 D1 08}喂，完二。\n你的弱点是什么？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e724_241.bf.json:9:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}嗯，这个嘛……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e724_241.bf.json:9:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}像这样从背后\n把我双臂锁住……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e724_241.bf.json:9:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 8A 05}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}不对，干吗问我的弱点啊！？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e724_241.bf.json:10:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0C 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}哦——从背后啊……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e724_241.bf.json:11:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0D 01 03 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 64 09}那家伙的背阔肌也相当不错。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e724_241.bf.json:12:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0C 01 03 01 03 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 86 08}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}您什么时候看的！？\n不对，为什么要观察它的背啊！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e724_241.bf.json:13:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_011",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0D 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}它回到原位时\n走得很慢，\n所以看得很清楚。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e724_241.bf.json:14:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_012",
